ac{∂}{∂x}({f}_{zy}(x,y,z)) \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\frac{{x}^{2}+xz}{(x+y+z)^{2}}) \\\\  & =\\frac{(2x+z)\\cdot (x+y+z)^{2}-({x}^{2}+xz)\\cdot (2(x+y+z)\\cdot 1)}{(x+y+z)^{4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(2x+z)(x+y+z)-2({x}^{2}+xz)}{(x+y+z)^{3}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, we evaluate ${f}_{zyx}(x,y,z)$ at $(1,1,-1):$  \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{zyx}(1,1,-1) & =\\frac{(2(1)+(-1))(1+1+(-1))-2({1}^{2}+1(-1))}{(1+1+(-1))^{3}}=\\frac{(1)(1)-2(0)}{(1)^{3}}=1\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483431 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186483504 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483431 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "0156998a-6e16-5b9a-9f34-3fa9b3ed9afa" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483431 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186268920 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483451 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186483455 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483451 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "345a4ba2-99a5-54c6-920b-943ebcfbdddc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483451 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186483391 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483455 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186483474 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483455 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "3fdcb306-4c4d-55b0-afc4-b7f0ddec864f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483455 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186335788 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483474 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186483431 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483474 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "7500e142-5145-59e0-8086-fdd6d710a0a6" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483474 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186382379 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483504 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "ec92f449-cc5d-5eb7-8ed8-e8baf8365b8f" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186483504 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186268923 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
